###Mapping
Mapping test::russetmeadow::mapping::MeadowMapping
(
  *test::russetmeadow::domain::MeadowPlot[plot]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [test::russetmeadow::store::MeadowDB]grassland.plot.plot_code
